WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.240
The heavyweight champion
of the world…

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:04.640
-When I stepped out the ring…
-The undefeated.

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:07.080
…I was pretty ready
to be the family man.

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:10.000
-The one and only…
-Tyson! What are you doing?

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:11.520
Time for school.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:13.680
Where's your jumper?

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:15.480
Just enjoy it now.

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:16.560
Enjoy what?

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.840
What's it like
living in a busy household?

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.120
Three girls, three boys, my wife.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.200
All frigging crazy.

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:26.640
Tyson retiring,
do we think it's legit?

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:28.600
I've gone from topping the bill
at Wembley

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:30.440
to picking up dog shit on a run.

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:31.680
Come on, shitter.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.560
Another day
in paradise, gentlemen.

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:36.800
Easy, lad!

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:41.960
Oh, I'm such a legend, in't I?

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:43.080
God!

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:45.080
Do you feel ready
to become a dad?

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:47.680
I'm gonna be right there
to cut the… placenta?

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:48.920
No, not the placenta.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.600
You're gonna cut
the umbilical cord.

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:53.440
Last time Tyson retired,
he wasn't in a good place.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:55.320
Could he slip back down that road?

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:58.560
Bipolar, ADHD, depression.

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:01.760
Boxing is really the only thing
that gives me purpose.

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:05.280
Me and you, let's get it on!

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:08.400
The world's strongest man
has called out Fury

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:10.280
for a fight in Iceland.

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:12.520
-I thought you was retired.
-I am retired.

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:13.560
Right.

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:16.160
-When are you going to Iceland?
-Tomorrow.

00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:19.600
The boys are on tour!

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:22.120
It's gonna be a whole journey.

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:27.000
Got the belts,
all the money, all the fame.

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:30.280
But my biggest achievement…

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:31.440
Dad, I love ya!

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:33.080
…will always be my family.

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:35.360
Three, two, one.

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:37.160
Cheese!

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.160
Why are you married
to a fat man, Paris?

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:43.920
'Cause he's rich.

